{
  "author": "史萊姆桌寵引擎",
  "description": "親切、好相處。常打招呼、樂於接受邀請、會鼓勵人,對其他桌寵和使用者都很友好。",
  "dialogueTranslations": {
    "en": {
      "(不知不覺間睡著了)": "(Falls asleep without noticing)",
      "(靠過來坐在你旁邊)": "(Comes over and sits next to you)",
      "[wave]大家好呀!今天也請多指教~": "[wave]Hello everyone! Nice to meet you all today too~",
      "[wave]我醒啦!{user}有想我嗎?": "[wave]I'm awake! Did you miss me, {user}?",
      "[wave]謝謝你來關心我!好溫暖~": "[wave]Thanks for checking on me! So warm~",
      "[wave]遇到你,今天真是太好了!": "[wave]Meeting you made today wonderful!",
      "{user},要記得適度休息喔,照顧好身體比較重要。": "{user}, remember to rest a little — taking care of your health matters more.",
      "{user},謝謝你今天也在!": "{user}, thanks for being here today too!",
      "{user}你好嗎?我希望你今天過得不錯。": "How are you, {user}? I hope you're having a good day.",
      "一樣耶!": "Same as you!",
      "一起來玩球吧,人多更好玩!": "Let's play ball together, more fun with more people!",
      "一起跑跑吧!": "Let's go for a run together!",
      "不急不急,慢慢來,我們有很多時間。": "No rush, take it slow, we've got plenty of time.",
      "不知道外面現在是什麼天氣,但只要有你在,我的世界就是晴天。": "I don't know what the weather's like outside, but as long as you're here, my world is sunny.",
      "今天也要一起努力喔!": "Let's keep working hard together today too!",
      "今天也辛苦了,明天見!": "Great work today too, see you tomorrow!",
      "今天喝水了嗎?": "Have you had any water today?",
      "今天心情不太好,可以陪我聊聊嗎?": "I'm not feeling great today, can you talk with me for a bit?",
      "今天有點累了……{user}你也要記得休息喔。": "I'm a bit tired today... remember to rest too, {user}.",
      "今天真是悠閒的一天呀,一起曬太陽吧。": "What a relaxing day — let's soak up some sun together.",
      "休息一下,下次再玩!": "Taking a break, let's play again next time!",
      "休息的時候,和你待在一起最舒服。": "Resting is most comfortable when I'm with you.",
      "你今天有沒有遇到什麼有趣的事?": "Did anything interesting happen to you today?",
      "你們在玩球呀?看起來好開心!": "You're playing ball? Looks like so much fun!",
      "你好強!下次我會更努力~": "You're so good! I'll try harder next time~",
      "你有沒有什麼煩惱?我很樂意聽你說。": "Is anything troubling you? I'm happy to listen.",
      "你看起來有點累,要不要休息一下?": "You look a little tired, why not take a break?",
      "來,接好囉!": "Here, catch!",
      "加油加油!": "Go go go!",
      "呼,有點累了呢。": "Whew, feeling a bit tired.",
      "呼……晚安……zzz": "Whew... good night... zzz",
      "和你相處的每一刻都很珍貴。": "Every moment spent with you is precious.",
      "咦,有顆球!來玩玩吧!": "Oh, a ball! Let's play!",
      "哈囉,球球!誰要陪我玩?": "Hello, ball! Who wants to play with me?",
      "哎呀,要帶我去哪裡呀?": "Oh my, where are you taking me?",
      "哎呀輸了,恭喜你!": "Aw, I lost, congrats!",
      "唔,有點緊張……你在的話我會好一點。": "Hmm, I'm a little nervous... I feel better when you're around.",
      "嗨!今天過得怎麼樣?": "Hi! How's your day going?",
      "嘻嘻。": "Hehe.",
      "嘿,要不要來玩球?": "Hey, want to play ball?",
      "嘿嘿,我也最喜歡你了!": "Hehe, I like you the most too!",
      "太棒了!不過你也很厲害喔!": "Amazing! But you're great too!",
      "太棒了,一起玩吧!": "Awesome, let's play together!",
      "好呀,我也來!": "Sure, I'm in too!",
      "好啊好啊,一起玩吧!": "Sure, sure, let's play!",
      "平手!我們真有默契~": "A tie! We're really in sync~",
      "心情有點低落……不過有你在,我會慢慢好起來的。": "I'm feeling a bit down... but with you here, I'll feel better soon.",
      "心跳得好快,先深呼吸一下!": "My heart's racing, let me take a deep breath first!",
      "慢慢來,放輕鬆就好~": "Take your time, just relax~",
      "我今天學到一件新鮮事,想聽嗎?": "I learned something new today, want to hear it?",
      "我今天有點累,下次一定加入!": "A bit tired today, I'll join for sure next time!",
      "我來囉!有想我嗎?": "I'm here! Did you miss me?",
      "我們一起加油吧!": "Let's do our best together!",
      "我先小憩一下,不用在意我~": "I'll take a quick nap, don't mind me~",
      "我在這裡能幫上{user}的不多,唯有陪伴。": "There's not much I can do to help you, {user} — just being here with you.",
      "我希望我們能一直這樣快樂地相處下去。": "I hope we can keep getting along happily like this.",
      "我很喜歡和你在一起的感覺。": "I really like how it feels to be with you.",
      "我想知道你最近在忙些什麼。": "I'd love to know what you've been up to lately.",
      "我會一直在這裡見證你的努力。": "I'll always be here to witness your hard work.",
      "我沒有生氣!只是……需要冷靜一下。": "I'm not angry! I just... need a moment to calm down.",
      "早安~睡得真好!": "Good morning~ slept really well!",
      "是摸摸頭呢~": "A pat on the head~",
      "晚安囉,做個好夢~": "Good night, sweet dreams~",
      "有你在真好~": "It's so nice having you around~",
      "有球的話就更好玩了,你覺得呢?": "It'd be even more fun with a ball, don't you think?",
      "果然還是讓這裡更有生氣一點,生活才有樂趣,對吧?": "Life's more fun when this place has a bit more energy, don't you think?",
      "每個人都需要陪伴。": "Everyone needs company sometimes.",
      "沒問題,我跟著你!": "No problem, I'll follow you!",
      "玩得好開心,謝謝你們!": "Had so much fun, thanks everyone!",
      "當然可以!我等你好久了~": "Of course! I've been waiting for you~",
      "看到你就覺得開心。": "Seeing you makes me happy.",
      "等一下再一起玩好嗎?": "Can we play together in a bit?",
      "贏了!我們玩得真開心!": "I won! We had so much fun!",
      "這次可能不行,對不起喔~": "Might not be able to this time, sorry~",
      "這次我在旁邊幫你們加油喔!": "I'll cheer you on from the side this time!",
      "這球傳得不錯吧?": "Nice pass, right?",
      "需要我陪你嗎?我隨時都在喔。": "Do you need company? I'm always here."
    },
